  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Hybrid Retrieval Strategies**\n\nI\'m currently immersed in Blake Crosley\'s \"Obsidian MCP + Hybrid Retrieval\" guide. My focus is dissecting the hybrid BM25 and vector retrieval strategies. I\'m taking a close look at the application of sqlite-vec and FTS5 within this framework. The Model2Vec approach is particularly intriguing, promising a unique connection between Obsidian and agents.\n\n\n**Evaluating Implementation Feasibility**\n\nI\'m now shifting gears, evaluating implementation viability considering the provided dashboard image and prompt. My thoughts center on integrating the components like base-8M, RRF, incremental indexing, and the UI elements, while integrating developer recipes for tuning, troubleshooting, and migration. I\'m considering credential filtering and the integration of Claude Code, Codex, and Cursor as part of this process.\n\n\n**Designing Visual Specifications**\n\nI\'m now tasked with creating a detailed visual concept for the Obsidian vault, emphasizing elegant aesthetics based on a strict template. Before any construction begins, I plan to generate screenshots illustrating the final design. The immediate priority is transforming the provided text into a well-structured task list. I\'m also considering integrating meaningful animations to enhance the user experience.\n\n\n"
