    prompt: "User interface of a futuristic high-tech Obsidian AI Knowledge Vault and Hybrid Retrieval dashboard strictly inspired by synthwave cyberpunk telemetry aesthetics. Deep dark obsidian slate-purple background. At the top right, a wide glowing sunset mountain landscape with warm orange, amber, and violet tones, silhouetted pines, with a glowing electric cyan frequency audio waveform equalizer line at the bottom. Circular glowing HUD gauges with neon orange arc meters, percentages (35%, 60%, 275), circular checkmark dials. Sleek glassmorphic dark purple cards with fine glowing borders, displaying hybrid BM25 and vector retrieval statistics, 32-chapter task checklist with checkboxes, latency charts, and a futuristic bottom docking bar with circular control buttons. Clean, sharp, ultra-professional UI design, no laptop or device frame."
