-between\">\n        <span className={isWeiss ? \'text-slate-600\' : \'text-slate-400\'}>p50 Latenz:</span>\n        <span className=\"text-emerald-500 font-bold\">23 ms (FTS5 + vec0)</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n"
    }
