  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Audio Synthesis**\n\nI\'m incredibly excited! I\'ve confirmed that a Vite app is running right in the browser. The Web Speech API is giving me instant, native German audio synthesis without any network overhead! It\'s so cool. I can imagine building a fantastic Audio Player with this technology.\n\n\n**Designing Audio Player Features**\n\nI\'m now diving into the design of the audio player modal. I\'m envisioning animated waveform bars with a glowing frequency theme to match the glass design. I\'m planning standard controls: play/pause, skip, a progress slider with scrub, and speed toggles. A voice selector will be included. Finally, I\'ll be implementing a chapter-by-chapter audio script navigator with live transcript highlighting to keep the user engaged.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 991166287
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
