  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Hover Effects**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting a subtle sparkle animation for the glass tiles on hover to evoke a futuristic telemetry aesthetic. The goal is an effect that enhances the user experience.\n\n\n**Analyzing Hover Refraction**\n\nI\'ve been dissecting the proposed hover effect. Specifically, I am focusing on the light beam sweep and the corner sparkle. For the sweep, I\'m working to define the specific color palettes for each glass tile variant, aiming for a precise, visually appealing refraction. Then, I am focusing on the sparkle details, debating between CSS, SVG, or a dedicated component.\n\n\n**Implementing CSS Sparkle**\n\nI\'m now implementing the CSS sparkle effect. I\'m leveraging a dedicated class to contain the sparkle, and it seems like setting `overflow: hidden` on a `.glass-telemetry-tile` (or even adding it directly to `.glass-rainbow-edge`) will be crucial for the rounded corners and containment of the animation. The key is ensuring that the shimmer sweep stays neatly within the rounded frosted glass tile. I\'m digging into `src/index.css` to confirm the existing properties.\n\n\n**Refining Overflow Strategy**\n\nI\'m now deep in thought about how to best handle the shimmer effect within the glass tiles. I\'ve realized putting `overflow: hidden` directly on the card might clip the border\'s `::before` element, so I\'m exploring alternatives. I\'m leaning toward a dedicated internal shimmer layer using either a `<GlassShimmerOverlay />` component, or a `.glass-shimmer-container` class with an absolute-positioned div. This will contain the effect reliably.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Shimmer Component**\n\nI\'m now fully committed to the `<GlassShimmer />` component approach. This is clearly superior, avoiding clipping issues with the rainbow edge and shadows. With this component, I\'m confident I can achieve true, scalable SVG telemetry sparkle stars that dynamically adjust based on the theme, and deliver a smooth CSS keyframe animation for the sweep and sparkles. I\'ll build `src/components/GlassShimmer.tsx` to include a prismatic highlight bar and a top-right telemetry starburst.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 689072127
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
