    session_summary: "{\"step_index\":240,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:03Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":242,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:13Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":244,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:15Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":246,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:18Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":248,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:20Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":250,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:24Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":252,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:25Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":254,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:29Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":256,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:30Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":258,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:35Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":260,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:38Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Enhancing UI Interactions**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the user experience of the inset tiles. I\'m thinking of adding a hover effect: `scale-105 shadow-md` with `transition-all duration-200` to the individual metric tiles to provide visual feedback to user interactions. I\'ll need to modify the `GlassMetricsCard.tsx` file for this implementation.\\n\\n\\n\"}\n{\"step_index\":262,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:44Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":264,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:46Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":266,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:48Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":268,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:51Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":270,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:53Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":272,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:54Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":274,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:56Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Verifying Glass Shimmer**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into `GlassShimmer.tsx` to meticulously verify the hover effect. The goal is to ensure the sparkle and shimmer are authentically smooth and engaging when triggered. I\'m keen on scrutinizing the implementation to guarantee a polished user experience with the glass tiles.\\n\\n\\n\"}\n{\"step_index\":276,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:16:58Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":278,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:17:02Z\"}\n{\"step_index\":280,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-23T21:17:04Z\",\"content\":\"Der **futuristische Telemetrie-Sparkle- & Shimmer-Effekt** f\303\274r alle Glass Tiles wurde erfolgreich implementiert:\\n\\n### Was umgesetzt wurde:\\n\\n1. **Optischer Fl\303\274ssigglas-Lichtstrahl (Liquid Glass Shimmer Sweep):**\\n   * Beim Bewegen des Mauszeigers \303\274ber eine Kachel gleitet ein diagonaler, spektraler Lichtkegel im 25\302\260-Winkel \303\274ber die Oberfl\303\244che.\\n   * **Modus \342\200\236Weiss\342\200\234:** Kristallklares Eisglas-Licht mit dezenten bl\303\244ulich-violetten Brechungen.\\n   * **Modus \342\200\236Bunt\342\200\234:** Holografischer Laser-Lichtstrahl m\\n<truncated 246 bytes>\\nht (`animate-telemetry-sparkle-spin`).\\n   * An der gegen\303\274berliegenden Kante funkelt ein kleinerer sekund\303\244rer Mikro-Lichtpunkt auf.\\n\\n3. **Subtile Kanten- & Tiefen-Physik:**\\n   * Sanfte Tiefenanhebung (`glass-telemetry-hover`) mit minimaler 2.5px-Elevation f\303\274r ein haptisches Feedback.\\n   * Feiner innerer Glanzrand (*Specular Edge Sheen*), der die Refraktion des Prismenrahmens akzentuiert.\\n   * Auch die inneren Kennzahlen-Kacheln der Statistikkarte reagieren jetzt mit Micro-Elevation und individuellem Glow.\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":178,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-24T20:20:14Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nFix the errors in the app\\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\\nfix_it_trigger: manual\\nerror 0: Internal React error: Expected static flag was missing. Please notify the React team.\\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-24T13:20:14-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-ago65sqytpdjhr7ajknsnq-187718158178.europe-west2.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-ago65sqytpdjhr7ajknsnq-187718158178.europe-west2.run.app\\nUser Email: zoschi1981@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":179,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-24T20:20:14Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/package.json\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking dependencies\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View package.json\\\"\"}}]}"
