    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwaCiYmIVb0unmtZJ5rIaKupYKxg55QDbwp0PffQfH5j126HSvv3uU0j_XZhKY_Jb_dDxIJbFOSnvnzdUBcvyi86KmOnVQ8QIZ4yBVJis-MbTj9oIiAXGKVMhg235gsKOchrjZxxc="
      title: "github.com"
    }
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGiwfdUbgXGrN1QMMT-bBDBB3Q7sG_N1SvNa3GFX_ZGdtJCKFA3cPlHCjI4EWj_PTQLDQzhlvRN7du_-6_bVnDhstOyvTNqgrzmSgSfkNrriTk4tRKucrwmWAontD0eifJWwIoOR6ujkGjJK9xo"
      title: "tistory.com"
    }
    summary: "The error message \"Expected static flag was missing\" in React is an \"Internal React error\" that often suggests notifying the React team[1][2][3]. This error has been reported in the `facebook/react` GitHub repository in several issues, such as #34111 and #25589[2][3].\n\nCommon causes and scenarios associated with this error include:\n*   **API Version Migration** The error can occur when migrating to a new API version where certain static properties are no longer supported[1].\n*   **Typos** Simple typos in static property names can also lead to this error[1].\n*   **Incorrect Hook Usage** A significant cause is the incorrect use of React Hooks, particularly when hooks are called after an early return statement within a component. This issue is especially noted in recursive components and seems to be more prevalent in React version 18 compared to React 17[2][4]. To resolve this, it\'s recommended to place hook calls before any early return statements[4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [dhiwise.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHCZTORa4Vm0YhLAO_VU1jr3XnvMBxqO2YEUaRXye7THjM_Lk-YXWPhQJQr0RFCINmFdSLQhcmSb65PCzC7xREQFC7hHvTSggTUSYiU72RuoOvgnkWELFJFD2Sx3S3YRZIJzy9fOv6iypR9gPpAmRUiTy1YuQsoWJ0XIDK8fD9Jp6S0HW3qN6SjMT5u_dpX6XIo5rg=)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHeY56Bwl01X1yFeMdi4_0w18eweKcs1O4yV4-ekH_yKniHOe43V2877329KC1x8BmzdFU_UuQ9-WIa1oASXVoX5tjUcoPLPE6GCLMLMZDuWRuCV67z9x2buHk7IpAs_FPoteI5ACg=)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwaCiYmIVb0unmtZJ5rIaKupYKxg55QDbwp0PffQfH5j126HSvv3uU0j_XZhKY_Jb_dDxIJbFOSnvnzdUBcvyi86KmOnVQ8QIZ4yBVJis-MbTj9oIiAXGKVMhg235gsKOchrjZxxc=)\n[4] [tistory.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGiwfdUbgXGrN1QMMT-bBDBB3Q7sG_N1SvNa3GFX_ZGdtJCKFA3cPlHCjI4EWj_PTQLDQzhlvRN7du_-6_bVnDhstOyvTNqgrzmSgSfkNrriTk4tRKucrwmWAontD0eifJWwIoOR6ujkGjJK9xo)"
